WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.770
So I asked my father.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.980
And there just happened to be three seats available!

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.360
There were also some first-class seats available,

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:14.450
but the economy seats were closer together, so I went with those.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.870
This is all thanks to you spending the money for the trip.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:23.120
Well, yeah, I really do appreciate you doing this,

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.040
but don't you have to go home for New Year's?

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.800
My family lets us do whatever we want, so I'm fine.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:30.920
You smell so sweet.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.170
Such a spoiled brat.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:34.590
Kanade-senpai.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:35.720
Hey!

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.640
What are you doing, Yuki-chan?

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.350
Kana-chan, Kana-chan.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:42.140
This is so cool!

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:44.940
They really do taste like bananas, just like the name implies!

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:46.400
But they're gifts for the family!

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.440
Your arm is so nice and fluffy.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.820
Don't open them!

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.440
Shut up you!

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:52.480
We'll end up eating them together anyway, so it's fine.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.650
Stop hugging it!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:55.820
We'll end up eating them together anyway, so it's fine.

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:58.410
That's not the point.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:01.200
Besides, you'll end up eating some at home too.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.750
You're right.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:03.950
Sheesh.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:06.830
Just you watch. You'll gain some weight over the holidays.

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.500
Don't worry, Senpai.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.840
I brought some for your family too.

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:13.420
Once we get there, I must say hello to your parents,

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:14.760
then tell them about our relationship, and then...

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:16.470
We're just classmates.

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:18.300
Then I'll look at every bit of Kanade-senpai in the hot spring.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.720
And tone it down a little.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:23.100
Hello, Saku-chan.

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:25.140
Eww.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:29.560
But Saku-chan, there aren't any hot springs at or near our house.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.860
And I wouldn't go in one with you for my own safety.

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:36.450
W–What?

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:37.530
What's the matter?

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:41.030
Aw, come on, Kanade-senpai.

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:44.330
There has to be a hot spring when we take a trip like this.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.660
And the cliché says it's always an open-air one.

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:48.710
It'll have unnaturally thick steam,

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:53.300
and rocks, fences, and shampoo bottles placed oh-so strategically.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.170
And we'll get really excited, and go...

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:55.670
"Saku-chan, you have big breasts."

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:57.420
Yuki-chan, I'm sorry about everything.

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:58.680
"Can I touch them?"

00:01:58.680 --> 00:01:59.680
"Oh, please, Senpai! Not so suddenly!"

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:01.760
Well, we were able to find a way home in the end,

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:02.430
"There!"

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:03.180
That's how the story would unfold.
Well, we were able to find a way home in the end,

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.970
and I'm happy about this,

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:05.470
It really would.

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:06.480
so I guess it's okay.

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:07.640
It really would.

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:12.020
The excitement's making my nose bleed...

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:14.320
I'm so sorry.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.630
Kanade-senpai.

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:39.420
Don't tell me we got off at the wrong stop.

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.680
This is the right one.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:41.590
Why?

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.760
There's no ticket booth or station staff...

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:48.230
It's rare to have them in this area.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.900
Besides that, is this really a legitimate train station?

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.360
It's written right there.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:59.110
This is really the middle of nowhere for people from big cities.

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.490
I'm sorry!

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:02.530
I've just never been anywhere like this before.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:08.950
So anyway, it took a while to get here, but how much longer do we have to go?

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:14.380
There are no buses around this time, so I think it'll take about an hour on foot.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.170
In this weather?

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:23.260
There should be a bus coming in about three hours, but we'd still have a forty minute walk.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:25.850
Um, what about a taxi?

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:29.850
There are only two of them in the next town, so I wouldn't count on it.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.150
Um...

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:36.400
What about forgetting to go home and going to find a hot spring?

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.570
No way.

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.190
We couldn't do that after coming this far.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:42.610
No!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:45.580
I'm not going if I can't take a bath with Kanade-senpai!

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:46.700
Geez.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:52.210
We can't leave you here or send you back, so give up already!

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:55.000
I can't find the energy to walk without a reward!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.460
You're full of energy right now!

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.670
Or do you want to go home by yourself now?

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:00.630
I don't want to!

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:04.010
Then what do you want to do?!

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.640
A hot spring, a bath, or boob...

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:10.720
Shi-chan?

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:13.440
I came to pick you up, Yuki-neechan.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.940
And you too, Kana-neechan.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.440
Thanks.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.440
It's been so long, Shi-chan!

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:24.240
Yuki-neechan! I can't breathe!

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:29.330
So, I heard there's an extra one coming because of Kana-neechan's screw up.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.290
Is that it?

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:31.370
Don't call me "it"!

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:35.170
Who is this kid, Kanade-senpai?

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.040
You're small too.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.000
Sorry, Saku-chan.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.670
This is our little sister, Shizuku.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:46.390
She's in... 7th grade, was it?

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.640
You forgot how old your little sister is?

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.140
That's so cold.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:57.600
By the way, I heard that you forgot my birthday until Yuki-neechan reminded you.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:00.650
Oh, Yuki-neechan, thank you for the gift.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.040
Um...

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:05.650
Shall we get going before it gets dark, Shi-chan?

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:08.490
Your little sister is cocky.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.620
Actually, she's rather tactless.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.660
Yeah.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:19.130
She's actually a good kid, but she treats everyone except for Yuki-chan like that.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:28.090
You have a pretty big house.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:31.890
We just have a lot of land since we've been farmers for generations.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:36.390
The family used to do a variety of things, but we only do farming now,

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:38.770
and there's a lot of land to start with around here.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.650
Oh, Shi-chan, where's mom?

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.690
She went to Kobe this morning.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.400
Why?

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:49.450
Dad got hurt while working there, so she went to accompany him.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.910
The injury wasn't serious though.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:54.580
Then you should've called us sooner.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:57.250
They're going to do some site seeing while she's there.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:02.090
And since you were coming home, I stayed here.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:06.970
It doesn't feel like home, Kana-chan.

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:10.140
But I'm here!

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.470
You're right.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.560
Um, this isn't much, but...

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.890
Thank you.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:17.980
Wow, that's...

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.230
That's the kompeito from Kyoto that you have to order in advance...

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:22.480
Man, your family is rich.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.570
It's really overwhelming.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:27.530
So, Yuki-chan, explain this.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.150
What?

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:32.200
Why are there only three left?

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.450
Well,

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:34.870
this one's for Dad...

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.200
this one's for Mom...

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:37.370
and this one's for Shi-chan!

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.160
Ah, I see!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:40.670
I see now.

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:44.250
What's so funny?

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:50.510
And, as always, why aren't there any for me?

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.010
Come on.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.640
I'll get started with dinner.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.720
I'll help.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.940
Shi-chan, the snow isn't as bad as usual this year?

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.190
Yukino-senpai!

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.820
K-Kanade-senpai's b-bed!

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.950
It really smells sweet.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.830
Senpai's chair!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.950
How could you tell it was that one...

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:21.870
Oh, Senpai in a junior high uniform is adorable too!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:24.040
Yukino-senpai, I want this one!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:24.380
That copy is...

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.380
I want one!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:25.500
That copy is...

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.960
I want one!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:27.840
You know, Saku-chan...

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.550
I'll at least take a picture with my phone.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:31.300
If you mess things up, I'll be the one who gets yelled at by Kana-chan...

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.930
Yes!

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:33.550
I think I sense her undies from this way!

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.260
so...

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:41.690
I wonder if Yuki-chan can keep Saku-chan under control.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.190
Kana-neechan,

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:50.240
you started calling Yuki-neechan "Yuki-chan."

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:53.200
W-Why, all of a sudden?

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.950
When you were home, you always called her "Yuki-nee."

00:07:56.950 --> 00:08:01.040
Well, it was...

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.790
Are you going to a college up there?

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:06.540
That's a quick change of topic, Shi-chan...

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:10.340
Well, I think so, if I pass.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.680
I'm trying for an art school, so it'll be
tough to get accepted on the first try.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:16.510
I might come home if I don't get in after a second try.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:20.060
So you're coming home in two years?

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:22.060
Hey, don't assume the worst.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:25.770
But the portrait you gave me didn't look like me at all.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:30.360
Anyway, Shi-chan, are you going to school every day?

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:31.530
Sometimes.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:36.110
Do your friends pick on you or something?

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.490
No.

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:38.580
Then...

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.580
Because it's cold outside.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.410
Hey now...

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.670
How's the dinner coming, Kana-chan, Shi-chan?

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.380
Do you want any help?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.500
It's okay.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.880
Mom did most of the preparation.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:54.630
Where's Saku-chan?

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.890
She's resting in the guest room.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:59.300
I think she's exhausted.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.260
I see.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.890
It was Kana-neechan's fault the travel money got used up, right?

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:06.730
And all the while you forgot my birthday.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.100
You got what you deserved.

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:09.360
Sorry.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:14.280
By the way, Shi-chan, how's school?

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.780
Kana-neechan just asked me that too.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.570
Oh, okay.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:21.080
She said she's not going because it's cold outside.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.250
Is that why?

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:24.830
Shi-chan, Shi-chan,

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.210
do you want to use my knit pants?

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.000
They're really warm.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.810
That's not why!

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:33.260
What's wrong, Shi-chan?

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:36.930
Being cold doesn't bother me.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:41.760
The two of you were always so close, both at home and at school!

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:44.100
It's not fair!

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:48.690
It's not fair that you can still be together!

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:50.810
Shi-chan...

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:42.720
Huh?

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:44.390
Where's the bath?

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:45.550
Where's the hot spring?!
